/msid-136179146,imgsize-1281688.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Watch: FedEx aircraft runs off runway at Miami airport on eve of Thanksgiving]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136178498.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A FedEx cargo aircraft overran a runway at Miami International Airport on Wednesday night, forcing the temporary closure of all but one runway on the eve of Thanksgiving. No injuries were reported. The FAA will investigate the incident, which comes nearly three months after an Amazon cargo plane overran another runway at the airport, killing five people.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-fedex-aircraft-runs-off-runway-at-miami-airport-on-eve-of-thanksgiving/articleshow/136178498.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watch-fedex-aircraft-runs-off-runway-at-miami-airport-on-eve-of-thanksgiving/articleshow/136178498.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-26T10:07:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Abhishek Mishra</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-136178604,imgsize-2391065.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Storm hits New York: Macy’s 100th Thanksgiving parade postponed for first time]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/136177443.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/storm-hits-new-york-macys-100th-thanksgiving-parade-postponed-for-first-time/articleshow/136177443.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/storm-hits-new-york-macys-100th-thanksgiving-parade-postponed-for-first-time/articleshow/136177443.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-26T09:55:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http